              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "போதி — pōti — \"to teach formally; to preach\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அந்த ஆசிரியர் மாணவர்களுக்கு நேர்மையைப் போதித்தார். anta āciriyar māṇavarkaḷukku nērmaiyaip pōtittār. That teacher taught the students honesty."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): போதித்தேன், pōtittēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A formal, often moral teach: the person taught takes -க்கு, the lesson -ஐ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "போதி (pōti) is a verb built on Sanskrit bodha, \"waking, understanding\" (CDIAL 9314), from the root budh, \"to wake, to know\": to make someone understand."
            }
          ]
        },
